sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor EXT as Sistema Externo
  participant GW as Webhook Endpoint (S8)
  participant DB as DB S8
  participant BR as Broker
  participant WI as Worker Integrações
  participant S? as Domínio afetado (pendente)

  EXT->>GW: POST /webhooks/{source} (signed)
  GW->>GW: validar assinatura + timestamp anti-replay
  alt assinatura inválida
    GW-->>EXT: 401/403 {error}
  else assinatura válida
    GW->>DB: persist raw event (received_at, payload) [id empotent: dedup por eventId]
    GW-->>EXT: 202 Accepted {receiptId}
    DB->>BR: (relay) publicar integration.event.received
    BR->>WI: entregar
    WI->>WI: valida/dedup (eventId)
    alt já processado
      WI-->>BR: ack (no-op)
    else novo
      WI->>S?: processar efeito de negócio (regra pendente)
      WI->>DB: update status=processed
    end
  end
  Note over GW,EXT: 202 significa aceite, não processamento completo
  Note over WI,S?: Efeitos podem ser eventualmente consistentes